    "turn_idx": 39,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, Representative Caster, thank you for joining us. Your committee's report recognizes the role of climate change in the spread of infectious diseases like COVID-19 and how environmental health is intimately linked with human health. Can you tell us more about what specifically you and your committees are doing to follow up on this finding and ensure that public health domestically and internationally is prepared for future climate-exacerbated catastrophes like COVID-19?",
